rumb Home Offices & Services Welcome to Saint Mary's College of California Career Center This is your gateway to unlocking a world of professional possibilities. We believe that the right resources, guidance, and opportunities can transform aspirations into reality. Whether you're a student exploring career paths, a recent graduate ready to launch your professional life, or an alumni seeking to enhance your current career, we are here to assist you at every step. Explore student resources below or visit the Career Center on campus. Career Compass The Career Compass is your guide to navigating college and career with confidence. It breaks the journey into four phases— Explore, Plan, Build, and Launch —to help you take the right steps at the right time. No matter where you start, the Compass can point you in the right direction. How Do I... If you need assistance, please contact us at careers@stmarys-ca.edu or schedule an appointment on Handshake. Start My Career Journey Create a Resume & Cover Letter Build a Professional Network Search for an Internship/Job Prepare for an Interview Negotiate an Offer Prepare for a Professional School Prepare for Graduate School Enroll in a Career Course Connect with Alumni Events & Workshops September 14 12:00 pm - 1:00 pm Resumes On-campus September 28 5:30 pm - 7:00 pm Mock Interviews On-campus September 30 5:30 pm - 7:00 pm Meet the Firms On-campus October 07 1:30 pm - 3:00 pm Fall Career Fair On-campus Career Center News Image NewsCenter In Their Own Words: Gracie Martin ’25 on Her Unexpected Route to NVIDIA, the AI Chip Juggernaut A Communication major, Martin never envisioned herself in tech. However, with support from family... Image NewsCenter In Their Own Words: Alexis Hackett is Encompassing Complexity—at Deloitte, at Saint Mary's, and in Her Own Identity A Cultural Event Coordinator at the Intercultural Center, she’s helping the SMC community... Image Career Center Saint Mary's Inaugural Pre-Med/Health Fair: A Thriving Success for Students and Professionals I’m thrilled to share that 90+ undergraduate students attended our inaugural Pre-Health Fair on... Image NewsCenter In Their Own Words: Business Graduate Student Brian Muganda Is Saying Yes to Every Opportunity After traveling from Nairobi to Moraga, SEBA grad student Brian Muganda hasn't slowed down a bit.... Visit the NewsCenter Contact Us Location: Ferroggiaro, Suite 203 Hours: 9:00am - 5:00pm Office Contact: (925) 631-4600 Graduate/Law School Advisor: Filippi Academic Hall - FAH 190 careers@stmarys-ca.edu Follow us on Instagram! Footer - Academics Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Footer - Admissions Admissions Apply Request Information Contact Admissions Resources Resources Library Bookstore Museum of Art Careers at SMC For the Media Footer - Financial Aid Financial Aid Tuition and Fees Scholarships University Credit Union Campus Info Our Campus Campus Map Parking & Transportation Accessibility at SMC Land Acknowledgment Emergency Information Immigration Enforcement Image 1928 St. Marys Rd Moraga, CA 94575 (925) 631-4000 © 2026 Saint Mary’s College of California Legal Nondiscrimination Policy Privacy Policy Title IX Login"
