nce Awards Image Faculty Handbook Image Forms Image Inclusive Excellence Image Open Faculty Positions Image Professional Development Funding & Grants Image Professional Development Programming Image Rank & Tenure Image Sabbatical Leave Image School Contacts RESOURCE CATEGORIES Image Adjunct Faculty Resources Image Campus Resources Image Faculty Search Resources Image Instructional Resources Image ITS Resources Image New Faculty Resources OFFICES, COMMITTEES, & MORE Image Academic Affairs Image Academic Senate Image Advising & Academic Success Image All Committees Image Center for Equity & Excellence in Teaching Image Faculty Welfare Committee Image Graduate & Professional Studies Educational Policies Committee (GPSEPC) Image Institutional & Educational Effectiveness Image Institutional Review Board Image Undergraduate Educational Policies Committee (UEPC) Back to top → Adjunct Faculty Special Compensation Work Assignments A helpful guide on the time-reporting process for Special Compensation Work Assignments. SEIU Collective Bargaining Agreement (CBA) The current SEIU Collective Bargaining Agreement (CBA) with Saint Mary's College. Notice: Exempt Classification for Course Assignments An official Notice regarding changes to adjunct faculty classification and related time reporting requirements. Course Bidding A Quick Start Guide for Course Bidding (instructions). Instructional Resources Jump to the Instructional Resources section of this page. New Faculty Resources Jump to the New Faculty section of this page. Back to top → Campus Resources For new and current faculty, we have a number of links to essential resources available around campus; whether you need to order textbooks or print syllabi for your class, you're sure to find what you're looking for below. Bookstore Campus Map Information Technology Services (ITS) Resources Parking & Transportation Student Disability Services (SDS) Title IX Office Back to top → Faculty Handbook View the latest version of the Faculty Handbook below or contact Rebecca Jabbour ( rsj2@stmarys-ca.edu ) for any questions. 2025-2026 Faculty Handbook 2024-2025 Faculty Handbook Past Faculty Handbooks Faculty Search Resources Full-Time Faculty Line Request Form → Faculty Position Posting Template → Guide for Faculty Search Committee → Back to top → Forms Intent to Apply Form Includes sponsor information, deadlines, a project overview, initial budget estimate, and a checklist of project details. Exception Request Form Completed for all requests including recruitment/hiring, promotions, stipends, position description studies/changes, and temporary/consultant hiring. Data Request Form Access various forms to submit requests for PowerBI Reports and Dashboards, Student Feedback Survey requests,  and requests to the Office of Institutional Research. Internal Routing Form Used to route and approve externally sponsored funding applications prepared by faculty or staff members of Saint Mary’s College of California. Travel Request Form Intended for faculty and staff seeking authorization for essential travel that supports core functions, research, academic programs, or critical operations. Back to top → Instructional Resources Academic Calendars Add/Drop Process (Start of Term) Course Reserves Final Exam Schedule ITS/Web Resources Print Shop Teaching Time Blocks Textbook Orders Back to top → ITS Resources Image Classroom Resources Classroom Equipment → Classroom Tech Checks → Classroom Technology Map → Ed Tech Resources Canvas Help → Ed Tech Workshops → Instructional Design (Ed Tech) → Office/Web Resources Create Faculty Profile → Gael Print → Telephone/Voicemail → Using GaelXpress 2.0 → IT Service Desk Location: Galileo Hall, Room 111 Call us: (925) 631-4266 More info → Back to top → New Faculty New to Saint Mary's? Browse the links below for quick access to essential resources and useful articles to get started. Campus Resources Committees Create Faculty Profile Employee Meal Plan First 90 Days Human Resources ID Request Form Instructional Resources ITS Resources Orientation & Onboarding Workload Planning Back to top → Sabbatical Leave Review the informational documents and required forms below for details about the sabbatical-leave process and the key steps needed for interested faculty. Sabbatical Leave Protocol Sabbatical Leave Request Form Sabbatical Proposal Guidelines Sabbatical Confirmation Form Sabbatical Leave Form D Back to top → School Contacts Jan Term & Seminar Melissa Benham mrb15@stmarys-ca.edu School of Arts & Sciences Karen Chew klc15@stmarys-ca.edu School of Economics & Business Administration Erinn Corzett ebb3@stmarys-ca.edu Kalmanovitz School of Education Constance Russell cvr2@stmarys-ca.edu Contact us Looking for more information, or perhaps there's a link or resource you can't find? Don't hesitate to reach out to us directly; we'd be happy to assist you. Academic Affairs academicaffairs@stmarys-ca.edu Filippi Administrative Hall, 2nd Floor Email us Visit our webpage Footer - Academics Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Footer - Admissions Admissions Apply Request Information Contact Admissions Resources Resources Library Bookstore Museum of Art Careers at SMC For the Media Footer - Financial Aid Financial Aid Tuition and Fees Scholarships University Credit Union Campus Info Our Campus Campus Map Parking & Transportation Accessibility at SMC Land Acknowledgment Emergency Information Immigration Enforcement Image 1928 St. Marys Rd Moraga, CA 94575 (925) 631-4000 © 2026 Saint Mary’s College of California Legal Nondiscrimination Policy Privacy Policy Title IX Login"
